<title>UK: LIFFE coffee reverses on NY dive, cocoa holds PM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee reverses on NY dive, cocoa holds PM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Reverses early uptrend and heads south after NY dives on milder Brazil weather. July off $55 at $1,835 at 1422 GMT.</p>
<p>COCOA - Holds modest gains but still in cozy ranges. July up four stg at 1,006 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Extends earlier losses after weaker NY. Aug down $1.10 at $325 support.</p>
</text>
